              <div><b>03</b><span>Ignoring maps and geographical relationships.</span></div>
              <div><b>04</b><span>Treating tribal studies as only community names.</span></div>
              <div><b>05</b><span>Reading the Jharkhand Movement without chronology.</span></div>
              <div><b>06</b><span>Using unverified material for legal topics.</span></div>
              <div><b>07</b><span>Collecting schemes without knowing their purpose.</span></div>
              <div><b>08</b><span>Keeping state current affairs mixed with everything else.</span></div>
              <div><b>09</b><span>Solving PYQs without analysing the underlying topic.</span></div>
